uot;&gt;암호화 보관 · 이후 재사용&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ECEFF1;strokeColor=#1A1A1A;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1A1A1A;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="750" y="140" width="190" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b_l1_ph2" value="[회의 처리 — 업로드된 녹음 기준]" style="text;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#555555;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="290" y="262" width="500" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b_q1" value="1. 음성 업로드&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:normal;font-size:12px;color:#444444;&quot;&gt;등록한 스마트폰으로 녹음 권장&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ECEFF1;strokeColor=#1A1A1A;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1A1A1A;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="290" y="290" width="190" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b_q2" value="2. STT + 화자분리&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:normal;font-size:12px;color:#444444;&quot;&gt;HAIV (Whisper)&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ECEFF1;strokeColor=#1A1A1A;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1A1A1A;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="520" y="290" width="190" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b_q3" value="3. 화자별 임베딩 추출&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:normal;font-size:12px;color:#444444;&quot;&gt;구간마다 벡터 생성&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ECEFF1;strokeColor=#1A1A1A;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1A1A1A;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="750" y="290" width="190" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b_q4" value="4. 등록 성문과 비교&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:normal;font-size:12px;color:#444444;&quot;&gt;참석자만 후보 · 임계값 적용&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ECEFF1;strokeColor=#1A1A1A;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1A1A1A;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="980" y="290" width="190" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b_q5" value="5. 실명 라벨 부여&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:normal;font-size:12px;color:#444444;&quot;&gt;미매칭은 &#x27;화자N&#x27;으로 유지&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ECEFF1;strokeColor=#1A1A1A;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1A1A1A;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1210" y="290" width="190" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b_q6" value="6. 화자 표기 회의록&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:normal;font-size:12px;color:#444444;&quot;&gt;실명 대본 생성&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ECEFF1;strokeColor=#1A1A1A;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1A1A1A;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1440" y="290" width="190" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b_l2_bg" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#BDBDBD;dashed=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=4;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#9E9E9E;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="450" width="1650" height="190" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b_l2_lb" value="② 회의 Context A&lt;br&gt;(사전 첨부 파일)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E8F5E9;strokeColor=#1A1A1A;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=16;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1A1A1A;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="55" y="465" width="200" height="160" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b_a1" value="1. 회의 전 문서 첨부&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:normal;font-size:12px;color:#444444;&quot;&gt;PDF · PPT 업로드&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ECEFF1;strokeColor=#1A1A1A;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1A1A1A;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="290" y="495" width="190" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b_a2" value="2. 텍스트·용어 추출&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:normal;font-size:12px;color:#444444;&quot;&gt;문서 파서&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ECEFF1;strokeColor=#1A1A1A;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1A1A1A;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="520" y="495" width="190" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b_a3" value="3. 키워드 목록 생성&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:normal;font-size:12px;color:#444444;&quot;&gt;회의별 자동 생성&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ECEFF1;strokeColor=#1A1A1A;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1A1A1A;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="750" y="495" width="190" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b_a4" value="4. STT 요청에 키워드 전달&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:normal;font-size:12px;color:#444444;&quot;&gt;키워드 부스팅 활용&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ECEFF1;strokeColor=#1A1A1A;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1A1A1A;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="980" y="495" width="190" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b_a5" value="5. LLM 후보정&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:normal;font-size:12px;color:#444444;&quot;&gt;문서 맥락 융합 (프롬프트 확장)&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ECEFF1;strokeColor=#1A1A1A;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1A1A1A;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1210" y="495" width="190" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b_a6" value="6. 요약 회의록 (선택)&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:normal;font-size:12px;color:#444444;&quot;&gt;문서 맥락 반영&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ECEFF1;strokeColor=#1A1A1A;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1A1A1A;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1440" y="495" width="190" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b_l3_bg" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#BDBDBD;dashed=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=4;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#9E9E9E;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="660" width="1650" height="190" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b_l3_lb" value="③ 회의 Context B&lt;br&gt;(화면 캡처 + 화면 인식)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF3E0;strokeColor=#1A1A1A;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=16;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1A1A1A;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="55" y="675" width="200" height="160" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b_b1" value="1. 화면 캡처&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:normal;font-size:12px;color:#444444;&quot;&gt;회의록 사이트 화면 공유 · 캡처 시각 기록&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ECEFF1;strokeColor=#1A1A1A;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1A1A1A;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="290" y="705" width="190" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b_b2" value="2. 서버 전송&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:normal;font-size:12px;color:#444444;&quot;&gt;녹음과 같은 기준 시각 사용&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ECEFF1;strokeColor=#1A1A1A;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1A1A1A;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="520" y="705" width="190" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b_b3" value="3. 화면 텍스트 추출&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:normal;font-size:12px;color:#444444;&quot;&gt;한국어 OCR 또는 멀티모달 LLM&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ECEFF1;strokeColor=#1A1A1A;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1A1A1A;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="750" y="705" width="190" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b_b4" value="4. 자료별 발화 태깅&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:normal;font-size:12px;color:#444444;&quot;&gt;자료 열람 시점 ↔ STT 시간 매칭&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ECEFF1;strokeColor=#1A1A1A;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1A1A1A;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="980" y="705" width="190" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b_b5" value="5. 회의 후 용어 보정&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:normal;font-size:12px;color:#444444;&quot;&gt;LLM이 STT 오류 용어 교정&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ECEFF1;strokeColor=#1A1A1A;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1A1A1A;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1210" y="705" width="190" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b_b6" value="6. 타임라인 노출&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:normal;font-size:12px;color:#444444;&quot;&gt;화면 텍스트 · 자료별 발화 표시&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ECEFF1;strokeColor=#1A1A1A;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1A1A1A;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1440" y="705" width="190" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b_l4_bg" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#BDBDBD;dashed=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=4;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#9E9E9E;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="870" width="1650" height="190" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b_l4_lb" value="④ 문서 연결&lt;br&gt;(단락 ↔ 문서)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F3E5F5;strokeColor=#1A1A1A;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=16;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1A1A1A;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="55" y="885" width="200" height="160" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b_c1" value="1. 문서 파싱&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:normal;font-size:12px;color:#444444;&quot;&gt;md 변환 · 블록 ID 부여 (회의 전)&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ECEFF1;strokeColor=#1A1A1A;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1A1A1A;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="290" y="915" width="190" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b_c2" value="2. 전사 + 문서 전달&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:normal;font-size:12px;color:#444444;&quot;&gt;단락 ID · 블록 ID를 함께 LLM에 전송&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ECEFF1;strokeColor=#1A1A1A;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1A1A1A;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="520" y="915" width="190" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b_c3" value="3. LLM이 문서 위치 연결&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:normal;font-size:12px;color:#444444;&quot;&gt;요약·제목과 함께 생성 · 프롬프트 고객사&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ECEFF1;strokeColor=#1A1A1A;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1A1A1A;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="750" y="915" width="190" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b_c4" value="4. 연결 정보 저장&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:normal;font-size:12px;color:#444444;&quot;&gt;단락별 문서 ID · 블록 ID&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ECEFF1;strokeColor=#1A1A1A;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1A1A1A;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="980" y="915" width="190" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b_c5" value="5. 음성 기록에서 하이라이트&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:normal;font-size:12px;color:#444444;&quot;&gt;단락 클릭 → 문서 위치 표시&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ECEFF1;strokeColor=#1A1A1A;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1A1A1A;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1210" y="915" width="190" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b_lg_note" value="성문은 생체정보로, 등록 동의와 보관 정책이 필요합니다" style="text;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontSize=13;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#555555;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="55" y="1087" width="1600" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b_e1" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;fontSize=12;fontColor=#222222;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;jettySize=auto;orthogonalLoop=1;exitX=1.000;exitY=0.500;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.000;entryY=0.500;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="b_p1" target="b_p2"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b_e2" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;fontSize=12;fontColor=#222222;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;jettySize=auto;orthogonalLoop=1;exitX=1.000;exitY=0.500;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.000;entryY=0.500;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="b_p2" target="b_p3"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b_e3" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;fontSize=12;fontColor=#222222;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;jettySize=auto;orthogonalLoop=1;exitX=1.000;exitY=0.500;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.000;entryY=0.500;en